1 NOTE A March 1973 government driver-dossier index (GOV-0001) reports a birth date of 25 September 1926 and names Aristac Ferreira Armond and Liliosa Paz Armond as parents. The 1975 marriage bann (NWS-0001) independently confirms the same parents (rendered Aristão Ferreira Armond and Liliosa Paz Armond) and additionally records him as natural de Eugenópolis. His birth is modelled as event E-0027 (date 25 September 1926 per GOV-0001, place Eugenópolis per NWS-0001, strong-evidence); no birth or baptism register has yet been located.
1 NOTE Deceased: the repository owner confirms that everyone from his grandparents' generation back — including this granduncle (b. 1926, brother of the owner's grandfather Geraldo Paz Armond) — is deceased. The retained government index remains private because the full page contains identity and dossier data for multiple people.
1 NOTE The preferred spelling "José Olavo Armond" normalises the two source forms, both preserved as variants: the government index (GOV-0001) prints "JOSE OLAVO ARMOND" (no accent) and the marriage bann (NWS-0001) prints "JOSÉ CLAVO ARMOND", where "CLAVO" is an evident misprint for "OLAVO". Both sources are strong originals, so the preferred name is well-founded.
