1 TITL Parish baptism certificate of Aristides Muniz Bittencourt (1922, Santa Luzia do Carangola), naming his parents and both grandparent couples
1 TEXT A 2019 certified copy of the 1922 baptism of Aristides (born 22 July 1922, baptized 20 September 1922 at the Matriz de Santa Luzia do Carangola, MG), a legitimate son of Deocleciano Muniz Bittencourt (P-0012) and Luiza Secundina de Azevedo (P-0013) — hence a brother of Antenor Muniz (P-0006). It names the paternal grandparents João Muniz Bittencourt (P-0019) and Susana Ritta Brandão (P-0020) and the maternal grandparents José Secundino de Azevedo (P-0038) and Thereza Fernandes de Azevedo (P-0039), which fixes the family's Carangola (MG) origin and establishes Luiza's parents.
