1 TEXT The original 1915 death register entry (Santa Luzia de Carangola, MG) of João Muniz Bittencourt (P-0019): died 12 September 1915 at Carrego do Boa Vista, aged 68 (so born c.1847), married to Suzana Rita Brandão (P-0020), leaving eleven children. It states he was "natural da Ilha de São Miguel" (Açores, Portugal) — primary confirmation that he was the Azorean immigrant of the line — and names his father Manoel Luiz Bittencourt (P-0042); his mother is not named.
