1 TEXT The 1812 Barbacena marriage of Anna Belizaria de Toledo — legitimate daughter of João José Ferreira de Toledo (P-0057) and Ritta Angélica Rodrigues (P-0058) — to Antonio Dias (of the Freguesia de Prados). Anna Belizaria is a sister of Ladisláo Egídio Ferreira de Toledo (P-0056); the record independently confirms the apical couple (whose distinctive wife, Ritta Angélica Rodrigues, anchors the match) and gives the father's name as "João José" (see P-0057 on the João/Joaquim variant). The officiating vigário is the Armond priest José Joaquim Ferreira Armond.
