1 TITL Parish marriage of Manoel Muniz Byttancourt and Francisca Roza do Espírito Santo (1 February 1845, Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, São Miguel)
1 TEXT Marriage on 1 February 1845 at Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, São Miguel, of Manoel Muniz Byttancourt (P-0042) and Francisca Roza do Espírito Santo (P-0047). The marriage date is exactly nine months before their son João's birth on 24 October 1845 (PAR-0022), consistent with timing. Both spouses' parents are present in folio 73r but not legible at current scan resolution. The bride's father initial tentatively reads "J" (consistent with José Pacheco, the working hypothesis from PAR-0022 context indicators), and a witness signature reads "António [José?] Pacheco." The marriage act is fully contained in folio 73r; folio 73v (p2) is a second, unrelated marriage also dated 1 February 1845.
1 REPO @REPO0016@
