1 TITL Undated Leopoldina notarial deed of sale of Toledo Concórdia / Ribeirão de São Bento land, naming the grandparents Mathilde Maria de Jesus and Ladisláo Egydio Ferreira de Toledo and the parents Antonio Zeferino de Toledo and Maria Perpétua
1 TEXT A mid-deed continuation folio of a Toledo-family notarial sale of land in the Fazenda da Concórdia and adjoining Ribeirão de São Bento, Termo de Leopoldina, MG. The grantors declare they hold the land by inheritance from their deceased grandparents (avós) Dona Mathilde Maria de Jesus and Ladisláo Egydio Ferreira de Toledo and from their parents and parents-in-law (paes e sogros) Antonio Zeferino de Toledo and Dona Maria Perpétua, whose inventory and partition were adjudicated at the city of Leopoldina. It is part of the same Concórdia succession as PRB-0003 (1877 sale deed) and PRB-0001 (1881 partilha).
